```eof

### Summary of Fixes:
- Added Blink layout feature flags (`LayoutNG`, `CSSContainerQueries`) to correctly render modern CSS flex/grid layouts used by Aternos.
- Relaxed cross-process isolation constraints (`IsolateOrigins`, `site-per-process`) so dynamic dashboard widgets and external iframe resources calculate dimensions properly.
- Kept root privileges and subshell execution active to prevent any recovery mode issues on Codespace creation.
